  "description": "Salt Security Azure App Service Site Extension that automatically collects HTTP request/response traffic for security analysis. Uses ASP.NET Core IHostingStartup to inject middleware without code changes. Supports .NET 6.0 and 8.0. Captures complete request/response data including headers, bodies, and timing information. Sends data to Salt Security API with Basic authentication.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "SaltSecurity.CollectorExtension",
