  "releaseNotes": "v5.0.2: Pure Azure Site Extension package - Removed lib folder, package now contains only Azure Site Extension structure (content folder with additionaldeps, store, applicationHost.xdt). Matches Kudu Universal package format exactly. Includes Salt API Integration with Basic auth, multi-framework support (net6.0, net8.0).",
